{"id":"629f88abafad3e3c","group":"56","path":"56/56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation.md","title":"Preservation of sorts","display":"prop-many-sorted-type-preservation — Preservation of sorts","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation","aliases":["56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation"],"display":"prop-many-sorted-type-preservation — Preservation of sorts","depends_on":["[[56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system]]"],"source_section":"§6.5.6","source_printed_pages":"256","source_ocr_blocks":[277],"source_verification":"原书文字层定位与数学陈述比对；本地展开及证明范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-many-sorted-type-preservation — Preservation of sorts"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f47f83c51f651d3\" href=\"?note=4f47f83c51f651d3\" title=\"56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system\">56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§6.5.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"256"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>277</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书文字层定位与数学陈述比对；本地展开及证明范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,\\mathcal F,a,b)\">\\(M=(S,\\mathcal F,a,b)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_\\bullet\">\\(\\mathcal V_\\bullet\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_s\">\\(T_s\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_S\">\\(T_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\circ}\">\\(T^{\\circ}\\)</span>、排序替换集和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)\">\\(R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4f47f83c51f651d3\" href=\"?note=4f47f83c51f651d3\" title=\"56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system\">56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall s,q\\in S\\;(s\\ne q\\Rightarrow T_s\\cap T_q=\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall s,q\\in S\\;(s\\ne q\\Rightarrow T_s\\cap T_q=\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)\\,\n\\forall s\\in S\\,\\forall t\\in T_s\\;(t\\sigma\\in T_s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)\\,\n\\forall s\\in S\\,\\forall t\\in T_s\\;(t\\sigma\\in T_s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall s\\in S\\,\\forall t\\in T_s\\,\\forall u\\in T^{\\circ}\\;\n(t\\to_R^S u\\Rightarrow u\\in T_s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall s\\in S\\,\\forall t\\in T_s\\,\\forall u\\in T^{\\circ}\\;\n(t\\to_R^S u\\Rightarrow u\\in T_s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_R^S\\subseteq\\bigcup_{s\\in S}(T_s\\times T_s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_R^S\\subseteq\\bigcup_{s\\in S}(T_s\\times T_s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：自由语法使变量与复合项不相等。变量排序由互不相交的变量族唯一确定，复合项排序由根符号的固定输出排序唯一确定，故不同排序的项集不交。对项结构归纳：变量情形使用排序替换的定义，复合项的各参数保持其输入排序，因而复合项保持输出排序。</p>\n<p>再对位置长度归纳可得两项辅助事实：排序项的每个子项具有唯一排序；在某个位置用同排序项替换子项，不改变整项排序。若一次归约使用同排序规则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\\to r\">\\(l\\to r\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\\sigma\">\\(l\\sigma\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\sigma\">\\(r\\sigma\\)</span> 都具有该规则的排序。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t|_p=l\\sigma\">\\(t|_p=l\\sigma\\)</span>，排序唯一性确定被替换子项的排序；位置替换的辅助事实随即给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 同排序。最后一式由前三式和关系定义得到。</p>\n<p>来源边界：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，§6.5.6，印刷第256页，OCR页块277，提供排序语法与规则定义；以上四个结论及证明为这些定义的本地推导，原书此处未单列本命题。已人工复核递归参数、变量分支、常元分支及替换分支；未宣称机器证明。OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"4f47f83c51f651d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"4f47f83c51f651d3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(S,\\mathcal F,a,b)$、$\\mathcal V_\\bullet$、$T_s$、$T_S$、$T^{\\circ}$、排序替换集和 $R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)$ 如 [[56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(S,\\mathcal F,a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V_\\bullet","display":false},{"tex":"T_s","display":false},{"tex":"T_S","display":false},{"tex":"T^{\\circ}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall s,q\\in S\\;(s\\ne q\\Rightarrow T_s\\cap T_q=\\varnothing).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)\\,\n\\forall s\\in S\\,\\forall t\\in T_s\\;(t\\sigma\\in T_s).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall s\\in S\\,\\forall t\\in T_s\\,\\forall u\\in T^{\\circ}\\;\n(t\\to_R^S u\\Rightarrow u\\in T_s).","display":true},{"tex":"\\to_R^S\\subseteq\\bigcup_{s\\in S}(T_s\\times T_s).","display":true},{"tex":"l\\to r","display":false},{"tex":"l\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"r\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"t|_p=l\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false}],"bytes":2324,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d50daf07b07fff2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"变量族与自由项构造满足 [[56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system]] 的条件，固定 $x\\in\\mathcal V_{s_1}$；排序唯一性及替换保持排序取 [[56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-330","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation.md]]"},{"id":"70b8760b956021f4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M$、$\\mathcal V_\\bullet$、$T_s$、$T_S$、$R$、$\\Sigma'$、$T'$、$\\Theta$ 与 $R^{\\Theta}$ 如 [[56-df-many-sorted-type-forgetting]]；排序保持见 [[56-prop-many-sorted-type-preservation]]。"}],"outgoing":["4f47f83c51f651d3"]}